title: Cheese and Pickle Sandwich
author: Andy Hay
method: oven
source: https://theeastcoastkitchen.com/viral-pickle-sandwich-low-carb-and-loaded-with-crunch/
protein: none
servings: 1
alternative_name: Viral Pickle Sandwich
ingredient_count: 3
---

  Preheat oven to 400°F.

Dry @pickle slices{6}(lengthwise, sandwich style) between two pieces of #paper towel{}.

On a #parchment-lined baking sheet{}, sprinkle ½ cup of @shredded old cheddar cheese{1/2%cup} in a circular shape.

Lay pickle slices over the cheese, and sprinkle remaining @shredded old cheddar cheese{1/2%cup} over top.

Bake for ~{16-20%minutes}, or until edges are golden and crisp.

Let cool on the #baking sheet{} for ~{10%minutes}.

> This is key for crispiness.

Once cool, carefully lift and fold or layer with your favourite @sandwich fillings{}.